Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: flashback7766 <https://github.com/flashback7766>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.34)
Description: Fast, local-first autonomous AI coding agent in pure Rust
 FlashAgent is an ultra-fast, local-first autonomous AI coding assistant
 built from scratch in 100% pure Rust. Features mid-flight steering,
 model prefill tracking, zero Chromium overhead, and multi-tier security.
